rmc-records-invalid-person = This person cannot be registered. Personal and biometric data are required.
rmc-records-already-registered = This person already has a personnel record. Open that record instead.
rmc-records-record-linked = This record is already linked to another person or no longer exists.
rmc-records-wrong-id = This person is wearing someone else's ID. Remove it before registration.
rmc-records-ambiguous-person = Existing records have conflicting biometric data. Resolve the conflicting records first.
rmc-records-unknown-position = Unknown
